flowchart LR
    Join[Company signup / identity verification] --> Configure[Team / addresses / contacts / SKU catalog]
    Configure --> Intake[Manual / CSV / configured store intake]
    Intake --> Prepare[Measured packages / goods / customs review]
    Prepare --> Compare[Deterministic top-ten carrier comparison]
    Compare --> Approve[Explicit selected offer confirmation]
    Approve --> Pay[Wallet reservation or Stripe checkout]
    Pay --> Book[Carrier purchase / confirmation / financial reconciliation]
    Book --> Documents[Labels / document bundles]
    Documents --> Tracking[Milestones / exceptions / store synchronization]
    Tracking --> Resolve[Support / invoice disputes / eligible claims]
    Admin[Platform admin: tenants / margins / diagnostics / audited assistance] -.-> Configure
    Admin -.-> Resolve
    Chat[WhatsApp / web chat: authenticated role-bound actions] -.-> Compare
    Chat -.-> Approve
    Chat -.-> Tracking
    Help[Published documentation / optional RAG / fallback] -.-> Prepare
    Freight[Unsupported freight: manual quote support] --> Resolve
